 display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> We choose the step size <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"329\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> to be as small as possible, in this case <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"330\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> This gives\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"331\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 12.037em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D440 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em; margin-left: 0.054em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-var\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2032\"><